InternalWorkerTokenStatusRequest.description:
``agent_ids=None`` returns every worker token in the account (the Settings token table);
a list narrows to those subjects (the per-agent detail read). Never a body ``account_id`` — the
scope is the header account the wall authenticated.

MatchedWorkloadsRequest.description:
``POST /resources/matched-workloads`` — a general scope-preview count/listing, not tied to
a specific policy. ``items`` is always present in the response (possibly empty);
``total_items``/``pagination_token`` are each populated only if the request asked for them.
